I stand in front of the supermarket.
The supermarket is large and bright.
The door opens automatically.
I go into the shop.
The shop has many goods.
There are stacks of baskets by the entrance.
I take a basket.
The basket is red and light.
I look for vegetables.
The section is right here.
I see a crate on the floor.
The crate is green.
There are many carrots in the crate.
I like carrots.
I choose a large bunch.
The bunch looks very fresh.
I put the bunch down into the basket.
Now the basket is not empty.
I walk further into the shop.
